revision 64182
shortdesc Straightforward pseudocode
longdesc The package permits writing pseudocode without much fuss and
longdesc with quite a bit of configurability. Its main environment
longdesc combines aspects of enumeration, tabbing and tabular for
longdesc nonintrusive line numbering, indentation and highlighting, and
longdesc there is functionality for typesetting common syntactic
longdesc elements such as keywords, identifiers, and comments. The
longdesc package relies on aliascnt, array, colortbl, expl3, l3keys2e,
longdesc xcolor, and xparse.
